      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This fails spordically - returning nothing.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "SSDP -s \"upnp:rootdevice\" and -l - sometimes produce no results",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Re-running doesnt seem to help.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But rebooting, and sometimes running Windows GUI SSDP will make it work again.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I really have no idea what this means. It could be other devies on my network (I dont think it happened when I had BLKQCL-Ddevice hooked right to my ethernet switch) - so it could be a quirk of other devides on my net, or an issue with the routers, or something wrong with how I join the multicast group, or something like that.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
